        "title": "Add CLI cards view",
        "body": "## Summary\n- Add `codexbar cards`, a one-shot terminal usage snapshot with a responsive provider card grid.\n- Add `codexbar cards --brief`, a compact Provider / Usage / Reset table with source/plan detail and enhanced terminal colors.\n- Reuse the existing `codexbar usage` fetch pipeline, summarize provider failures in a footer, and document the new command.\n\n## Test plan\n- `swift test --filter 'CLICards|CLITerminalCapabilities'`\n- `swift build --product CodexBarCLI -c release`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `make check` reaches SwiftFormat cleanly, then fails on this Linux host when SwiftLint/SourceKit cannot load `libsourcekitdInProc.so`.\n\n## Notes\n- Root screenshot artifacts and the release-owned changelog entry were removed from the branch after review feedback.\n- `Package.swift` and `Package.resolved` are intentionally unchanged in the final PR surface.\n- Enhanced rendering now defaults only on Kitty/Ghostty/WezTerm/truecolor-capable terminals, with `CODEXBAR_CARDS_ENHANCED=1` as an explicit override.",
